ngwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/photo_6311951992414651853_y_130681594767f38abb2e6b5-1024x1280.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"彭泳熙 直樂viuriety Carson老師都有參加真人選秀節目《THE STAGE OF VOICE》（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1200\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/photo_6311951992414651853_y_130681594767f38abb2e6b5-1024x1280.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Carson老師都有參加真人選秀節目《THE STAGE OF VOICE》（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/saveclip.app_346840344_1970224413147992_1953972423211786496_n_77319736067f383156c368-1024x1279.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"彭泳熙 直樂viuriety 彭泳熙前男友亦大有來頭，就係曾參加《全民造星V》二十強止步嘅李嘉俊Carson，亦係男團「MATCH」成員。同時，二人亦一同參與今次真人選秀節目《CHILL CLUB X THE FIRST TAKE: THE STAGE OF VOICE》晉身20強（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1199\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/saveclip.app_346840344_1970224413147992_1953972423211786496_n_77319736067f383156c368-1024x1279.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>彭泳熙前男友亦大有來頭，就係曾參加《全民造星V》二十強止步嘅李嘉俊Carson，亦係男團「MATCH」成員。同時，二人亦一同參與今次真人選秀節目《CHILL CLUB X THE FIRST TAKE: THE STAGE OF VOICE》晉身20強（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/273199695_657291478940910_6110871249576339299_n_38190565662ef4ff8b2950-819x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"彭泳熙 直樂viuriety 彭泳熙穿上旗袍襯貓耳，不經意的性感。（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/273199695_657291478940910_6110871249576339299_n_38190565662ef4ff8b2950-819x1024.jpg\" width=\"819\"/></a><figcaption>彭泳熙穿上旗袍襯貓耳，不經意的性感。（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/292254851_443356280976568_8577239767457970718_n_192380324862ef509561ad1-820x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"彭泳熙 直樂viuriety 彭泳熙細細個已經好鍾意打機，中學畢業後加入女子職業電競隊。（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/292254851_443356280976568_8577239767457970718_n_192380324862ef509561ad1-820x1024.jpg\" width=\"820\"/></a><figcaption>彭泳熙細細個已經好鍾意打機，中學畢業後加入女子職業電競隊。（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/245059465_843102656570885_4808643787093525992_n_31147486262ef5058ebdfc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"彭泳熙 直樂viuriety 彭泳熙主要做有關電競的工作，例如做遊戲比賽主持，電競旁述等。（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"574\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.orientalsunday.hk/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/245059465_843102656570885_4808643787093525992_n_31147486262ef5058ebdfc.jpg\" width=\"803\"/></a><figcaption>彭泳熙主要做有關電競的工作，例如做遊戲比賽主持，電競旁述等。（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-williamng98-jayden.lamtung-aliceee.lll__18083693486abcc6beecb74-1024x1365.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"彭泳熙 直樂viuriety （圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/-williamng98-jayden.lamtung-aliceee.lll__18083693486abcc6beecb74-1024x1365.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@pangwhei）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:43:03.852065+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2039,"images":15,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:46.898363+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:48.244003+00:00","content_hash":"837c763c2055a1446754c2f8f6e81479b351e8da4b75f2ade38c24bd57747715","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}